    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Prime Coastal Site – C. 0.49 Acre, Curracloe, Co. Wexford\r\n\r\nAn exceptional opportunity to acquire a superb c. 0.49 acre approx.  site in one of County Wexford's most sought-after coastal locations. Ideally positioned on the outskirts of the picturesque village of Curracloe, this attractive site offers the perfect setting to create a dream home in an area renowned for its outstanding natural beauty and enviable lifestyle.\r\n\r\nCurracloe is celebrated for its magnificent Blue Flag beach, stretching for miles along Ireland's spectacular east coast. The area is synonymous with breathtaking scenery, unspoilt sand dunes and the beautiful Raven Nature Reserve, offering an abundance of walking trails and outdoor pursuits. The recently opened Raven Point Hotel further enhances the area's appeal, providing excellent dining and hospitality just moments away.\r\n\r\nThe village itself enjoys a welcoming community atmosphere and offers an excellent range of everyday amenities, including supermarkets, local shops, cafés, pubs, takeaway outlets, a popular pizza restaurant, schools, churches and sporting facilities. The bustling town of Wexford is approximately 10 minutes away, offering an extensive selection of shopping, restaurants, secondary schools, healthcare services and excellent transport links.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking to build a distinctive family residence, a luxurious coastal retreat or a future investment in one of Ireland's most desirable seaside locations, this outstanding site presents a rare and exciting opportunity.\r\n\r\n\r\nA rare opportunity to secure a premium site in one of Ireland's most desirable coastal destinations.\r\n\r\n(Subject to the necessary planning permission and local needs, where applicable.)\r\n\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n•\tC. 0.49 acre site.\r\n•\tPrime location on the outskirts of Curracloe Village.\r\n•\tMinutes from Curracloe's renowned Blue Flag beach.\r\n•\tClose to the Raven Point Hotel and Raven Nature Reserve.\r\n•\tExcellent selection of local amenities nearby.\r\n•\tApproximately 10 minutes from Wexford Town.\r\n•\tSuperb opportunity to create a bespoke home in an exclusive coastal setting.\r\n•\tPeaceful countryside surroundings with easy access to the coast.\r\n\r\n\r\nDirections\r\nY21 PN20 ( house in front ) \r\nComing from Wexford direction, proceed through Curracloe village, passing Hammels centra to the right hand side and passing Ravenport resort hotel, continue on straight for a further 2.3km, and the site will be located on the left hand side, down the lane, sign outside."
      }
